 "description": "<p>Illoqqortoormiut-DMI atmospheric monitoring station</p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/vejret/byvejr/by/vis/GL/4339/Ittoqqortoormiit,%20Gr%C3%B8nland/\">Weather forecast</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/arkiver/vejrarkiv/\">Weather archive</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/uploads/pics/klima_ittoqqortoormiit.png\">Climate</a></p><p>Monitoring site for atmospheric composition.</p><p>Station within the Network for the Detection of Atmospheric Composition Change (NDACC)</p><p>http://ndacc.dmi.dk/ndacc-dmi/illoqqortoormiut/station-info/</p><p><a href=\"http://www.ndsc.ncep.noaa.gov/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.ndsc.ncep.noaa.gov/</a></p><p>Station within the NASA Aeronet http://aeronet.gsfc.nasa.gov/</p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Instrument &amp; Period</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Parameter</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cooperating Institutions</strong></p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>SONDE Aerosol</p><p>1994-1996</p></td><td><p>Aerosol profiles</p></td><td><p>DMI, U. Wyoming USA</p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>SONDE Ozone (ECC type)</p><p>1989-</p></td><td><p>Ozone profiles</p></td><td><p>DMI</p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>UV Vis Spectrometer, SAOZ ,</p><p>1991-</p></td><td><p>Total Column: NO2 , Ozone</p></td><td><p>LATMOS, France , DMI</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p>WOUDC public data: <a href=\"http://www.woudc.org/data_e.html\">http://www.woudc.org/data_e.html</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
